Article 6
(1) Prevention of violence against women as referred to in Article 5 letter a is carried out in an integrated manner coordinated by the Regional Apparatus that has the main duties and functions in the field of women's empowerment and child protection.
(2) Prevention as referred to in paragraph (1) is carried out by involving:
a. family;
